        {
          "question": "e-7654",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/worked-solution",
          "value": "Isolating the cubic term, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt[3]{x+3}+1 & \\ge 0 \\\\ \\sqrt[3]{x+3} & \\ge -1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we cube both sides and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(\\sqrt[3]{x+3})}^{3} & \\ge {(-1)}^{3} \\\\ x+3 & \\ge -1 \\\\ x & \\ge -4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
